>> a := Yam-khoom tshiab.
>> b := Yam-khoom tshiab.
>> c := a.
Tawm sau-ntawv: a chaw-nyob-nco cov-tus-ntawv ? 0, kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: a chaw-nyob-nco cov-tus-ntawv ? 1, kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: a chaw-nyob-nco = b chaw-nyob-nco, kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: a chaw-nyob-nco = c chaw-nyob-nco, kab-tshiab.
